1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
It's an incredible experience.

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,933
It even changed my life a little.

3
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:09,567
My name is Juliana, I'm Colombian.

4
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:12,200
I arrived in August 2025.

5
00:00:12,217 --> 00:00:15,267
I started at A2, now I'm at C1.

6
00:00:17,467 --> 00:00:20,050
I wanted to study here, in France,

7
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,500
to continue my studies here.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,500
So I decided to learn French.

9
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:26,583
And I found it's easier

10
00:00:26,583 --> 00:00:28,267
and more efficient to do it in France.

11
00:00:28,267 --> 00:00:30,633
We have lots of chances to practice.

12
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:31,917
Not only in class,

13
00:00:31,917 --> 00:00:35,133
but at the supermarket, at restaurants…

14
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:39,500
All the teachers are really nice,

15
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,700
and they help us.

16
00:00:41,707 --> 00:00:44,550
It's great, because we always feel

17
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:47,500
supported, not alone in this experience.

18
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,000
When we played board games,

19
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,767
we really laughed, we had so much fun.

20
00:00:55,767 --> 00:00:57,617
And at the same time, we were learning…

21
00:00:57,617 --> 00:01:00,467
I think it was direct and indirect objects.

22
00:01:00,483 --> 00:01:03,467
It's really fun, we laugh a lot,

23
00:01:03,467 --> 00:01:04,700
but we also learn a lot.

24
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:10,250
I went to a wine cellar in Lyon,

25
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:13,053
to eat cheese and drink wine.

26
00:01:13,053 --> 00:01:14,533
It was really interesting,

27
00:01:14,533 --> 00:01:17,100
we learned the whole process.

28
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:20,533
It's amazing to see things face to face,

29
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:22,633
not just online, in a picture.

30
00:01:24,833 --> 00:01:27,033
I like Lyon because it's calm,

31
00:01:27,033 --> 00:01:28,500
but there's a lot to do:

32
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,967
museums, restaurants…

33
00:01:30,973 --> 00:01:32,567
So it's really great.

34
00:01:34,767 --> 00:01:36,587
It's an incredible experience.

35
00:01:36,587 --> 00:01:38,700
It even changed my life a little.

36
00:01:38,717 --> 00:01:40,367
I recommend it, you'll see!
